  "protocol": "Global temporal expanding windows. Equal mean across 3 validation folds. Final 15% of timestamps untouched until selection. All unseen items with >=5 training ratings are ranked; graded relevance >=3/5 with gain=(rating-2.5)/2.5; at least 5 positive training ratings per evaluated user. Test is warm-user/warm-item only. SVD dimensions=32, restart=.15, 30 PPR steps fixed before search. Scores use per-query percentile ranks. No diversity reranking.",
